{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Playable Game will be better from what you just see in screenshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndianOps supports Multiplayer + SinglePlayer Tactical\u00a0 Shooter with TPP+FPP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can expect min. 1 update every 1-2 month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I starts working on this project as my portfolio but now I'll keep working on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At start IndianOps will support only P2P Multiplayer laters on I'll add Dedicated Servers (depends on funds).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I will try to add GameModes that you will suggest , so share your idea's I'll make them reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621560?t=1743180541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621560?t=1743180541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621560/fe45f36a61d5b624e17a64b967de9ff872bf0d3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743180541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621560/fe45f36a61d5b624e17a64b967de9ff872bf0d3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743180541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross-Platform\u00a0(Windows + Android)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Maps and Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Weapon and Character with Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><